  <section class="card">
    <h1>About RandomIPGen</h1>
    <p>RandomIPGen is a small developer utility that generates random IPv4 and IPv6 addresses for testing, prototyping, and networking experiments.</p>
    <p>Generated addresses are random examples. They do not belong to real devices and are not guaranteed to be publicly routable or online.</p>
    <p>Found a bug? <a href="https://github.com/windows10fan648/RandomIPGen/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Back to generator</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
